    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a great start, really hits the emotional notes. But I want to make sure we're prepared for the tougher critics. Some people argue that it's actually irresponsible to prioritize overseas aid when we have massive issues with homelessness and infrastructure decay right here at home. How can we frame the argument so it doesn't just sound like we're ignoring our own people's problems?",
