    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that helps. i guess i'm just worried that some donors might think this is all just a way to justify endless spending without real accountability. do you think there's any valid argument that we should actually be scaling back foreign aid significantly to focus on national sovereignty, or is that just a bad-faith argument used to ignore the global crisis?",
